WEBVTT

01:30.206 --> 01:33.292
Reach for the sky!

01:33.376 --> 01:35.586
Oh, no! Sheriff Woody!

01:35.670 --> 01:38.088
I'm here to stop you,
One-Eyed Bart.

01:39.633 --> 01:40.841
How'd you know it was me?

01:40.925 --> 01:42.635
Are you gonna come quietly?

01:42.719 --> 01:43.927
You can't touch me, Sheriff!

01:44.012 --> 01:47.306
I brought my attack dog
with the built-in force field.

01:47.390 --> 01:51.352
Well, I brought my dinosaur
who eats force-field dogs.

01:52.812 --> 01:55.564
Yipe, yipe, yipe, yipe!
You're going to jail, Bart!

01:55.649 --> 01:58.484
Say goodbye to the wife
and Tater Tots.
